QUESTION: Q1 Total revenue
INTENT   : Sum money actually earned per item line
ASSUMPTION: Revenue = SUM(net_amount) over quantity>0 items; no join needed (a join could only filter, not fan out; verified 1 payment per order). Cancelled/Returned orders still counted at item level - see Q-revenue-by-status for the split.
SQL      :
SELECT ROUND(SUM(net_amount),0) AS total_revenue_vnd, COUNT(*) AS item_lines
       FROM order_items
RESULT   :
 total_revenue_vnd  item_lines
        28141523.0       31114
VALIDATE : PASS - must equal Python/pandas ground truth 28,141,523 VND (EDA Stage 3)

