QUESTION: Q2 Top 10 products by revenue
INTENT   : Rank products by money earned
ASSUMPTION: Group the ITEM fact by product (grain = item line, no fan-out), then join products for names.
SQL      :
SELECT p.product_id, p.product_name, p.category,
              ROUND(SUM(i.net_amount),0) AS revenue_vnd,
              SUM(i.quantity) AS units_sold
       FROM order_items i
       JOIN products p ON p.product_id = i.product_id
       GROUP BY p.product_id, p.product_name, p.category
       ORDER BY revenue_vnd DESC LIMIT 10
RESULT   :
