QUESTION: Q4 Monthly revenue
INTENT   : Time series of revenue
ASSUMPTION: month = strftime('%Y-%m', order_datetime); join items->orders is 1:N safe (orders deduped to unique order_id).
SQL      :
SELECT strftime('%Y-%m', o.order_datetime) AS month,
              ROUND(SUM(i.net_amount),0) AS revenue_vnd,
              COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) AS orders
       FROM order_items i JOIN orders o ON o.order_id=i.order_id
       GROUP BY month ORDER BY month
