QUESTION: Q8 Repeat customer rate
INTENT   : Loyalty share
ASSUMPTION: Denominator = customers who have placed >=1 order (4,892 of 5,000 registered ever bought). Customers with 0 orders are excluded, stated as assumption.
SQL      :
WITH orders_per_cust AS (
             SELECT customer_id, COUNT(*) AS n FROM orders GROUP BY customer_id)
       SELECT ROUND(100.0*SUM(CASE WHEN n>=2 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END)/COUNT(*),1) AS repeat_rate_pct,
              COUNT(*) AS customers_with_orders,
              SUM(CASE WHEN n>=2 THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS repeat_customers
       FROM orders_per_cust
RESULT   :
 repeat_rate_pct  customers_with_orders  repeat_customers
            92.5                   4892              4526
VALIDATE : PASS - expect ~92.5% matching EDA

