QUESTION: Q9 Most popular payment method
INTENT   : Popularity = order volume (assumption)
ASSUMPTION: Using the order header's payment_method attribute (1 per order after dedupe). Revenue split included for context.
SQL      :
SELECT o.payment_method, COUNT(DISTINCT o.order_id) AS orders,
              ROUND(SUM(i.net_amount),0) AS revenue_vnd
       FROM orders o JOIN order_items i ON i.order_id=o.order_id
       GROUP BY o.payment_method ORDER BY orders DESC
